{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03524",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.51,
      "end_seconds": 13.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "good afternoon, uh, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.28,
      "end_seconds": 23.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. Okay, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.79,
      "end_seconds": 31.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Um, so... being very stressed. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.27,
      "end_seconds": 34.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.0,
      "end_seconds": 45.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "text": "Let me think, it's been going on for one week. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.58,
      "end_seconds": 51.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.39,
      "end_seconds": 63.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten. And tingling, too. With tingling, I'd give it a five, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.89,
      "end_seconds": 69.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.67,
      "end_seconds": 75.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Well, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.0,
      "end_seconds": 77.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.11,
      "end_seconds": 83.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.09,
      "end_seconds": 87.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "alright, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.47,
      "end_seconds": 91.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.58,
      "end_seconds": 94.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.37,
      "end_seconds": 99.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.29,
      "end_seconds": 103.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.61,
      "end_seconds": 133.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 142.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "I've had asthma for two years now i did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.42,
      "end_seconds": 144.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "understood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.61,
      "end_seconds": 148.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.65,
      "end_seconds": 151.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 153.93,
      "end_seconds": 163.85,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Erm, you know, he is on warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.89,
      "end_seconds": 168.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 169.72,
      "end_seconds": 171.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "about six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.49,
      "end_seconds": 176.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Any back pain, headache or visual loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.26,
      "end_seconds": 183.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "I, I haven't had back pain, headache or visual loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.12,
      "end_seconds": 187.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Ah. Any sign of loss of bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.14,
      "end_seconds": 192.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "No loss of bladder control, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.45,
      "end_seconds": 197.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.46,
      "end_seconds": 203.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "erm, uh, no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.55,
      "end_seconds": 206.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.0,
      "end_seconds": 211.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.86,
      "end_seconds": 224.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.42,
      "end_seconds": 233.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.16,
      "end_seconds": 265.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 64, BP is 109 over 70, SpO2 99 percent on room air, temp 36.6 degrees, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.96,
      "end_seconds": 270.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.51,
      "end_seconds": 272.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.78,
      "end_seconds": 275.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.63,
      "end_seconds": 298.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "The leg gives way on testing but the strength returns when you are distracted, and the the reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.66,
      "end_seconds": 306.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.07,
      "end_seconds": 324.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It points towards a likely functional neurological disorder. I can't rule out a spinal problem yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.79,
      "end_seconds": 327.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.61,
      "end_seconds": 349.27,
      "duration_seconds": 16.66,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a likely functional neurological disorder, but I'd like to confirm. I'm gonna order an MRI scan, for leg weakness. I'm going to order blood tests, for neurological symptoms"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.06,
      "end_seconds": 358.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Actually, do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.12,
      "end_seconds": 379.58,
      "duration_seconds": 19.46,
      "text": "This is real and treatable, the nervous system is working differently, not damaged. I'm going to send a referral to the neurology clinic. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. We'll catch up after the scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.56,
      "end_seconds": 384.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Mm, uh, good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.69,
      "end_seconds": 395.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "can you tell me the the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.19,
      "end_seconds": 403.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "So, I come back after the scan. Is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.93,
      "end_seconds": 411.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.51,
      "end_seconds": 415.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.94,
      "end_seconds": 417.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}